00:21:52.770 --> 00:21:54.210
 What's up Marvel fans?

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:55.420
I am here with Benedict Wong.

00:21:55.420 --> 00:21:56.220
How are you?

00:21:56.220 --> 00:21:59.940
 Hello, hello, ecstatic,
excited, a bit tired,

00:21:59.940 --> 00:22:03.550
bleary eyed from
5:00 AM work call,

00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:06.360
but as soon as I get in
there-- well, these are

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:07.710
waking me up as well actually.

00:22:07.710 --> 00:22:11.220
[CHEERING] So, oh, it's just
fizzing with excitement,

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.410
you know?

00:22:13.410 --> 00:22:15.940
 It's an exciting
time to be here.

00:22:15.940 --> 00:22:20.670
So you've been busy, Wong
has been very busy in Marvel

00:22:20.670 --> 00:22:24.510
Studios, Shang-Chi and the
Legend of the Ten Rings, now

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:27.660
Spider-Man: No Way Home,
and, not to mention,

00:22:27.660 --> 00:22:29.760
your upcoming film,
Doctor Strange

00:22:29.760 --> 00:22:31.230
in the Multiverse of Madness.

00:22:31.230 --> 00:22:33.540
There's a lot weighing
on Wong's shoulders.

00:22:33.540 --> 00:22:34.870
How's he handling it?

00:22:34.870 --> 00:22:36.930
 I'm OK with a plum.

